      "scene": "river",
      "time": "週二 20:06",
      "bg": "embankment",
      "cast": [
        "yijun_embankment"
      ],
      "kind": "scene",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "你往右讓。她從旁邊跑過，轉進橋下。你跟了幾步，還是照自己的速度跑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "river_08",
      "scene": "river",
      "time": "週二 20:06",
      "bg": "embankment",
      "cast": [
        "yijun_embankment"
      ],
      "kind": "scene",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "折返時，她從對面抬手向你打招呼。你也抬起手，她已經跑過去了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "river_09",
      "scene": "river",
