      "scene": "station",
      "time": "週五 19:22",
      "bg": "xinyi",
      "cast": [
        "jason"
      ],
      "kind": "scene",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "他朝人群偏了下頭。「走啦，我帶你過去。」你把手機收起來，跟著他走。",
      "when": {
        "choice": "jason_choice",
        "value": "admit"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "station_06",
      "scene": "station",
      "time": "週五 19:22",
      "bg": "xinyi",
      "cast": [
        "ray",
        "jason"
      ],
      "kind": "scene",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "一個戴帽子的男生走過來。Jason 朝你偏了一下頭：「我同事，立翔。平常自己跑河堤。」"
    },
    {
      "id": "station_07",
      "scene": "station",
      "time": "週五 19:22",
      "bg": "xinyi",
      "cast": [
        "ray",
        "jason"
      ],
      "kind": "scene",
      "speaker": "Ray",
      "text": "你好，我 Ray。今天跟我們這組，五公里，可以嗎？"
    },
    {
      "id": "station_08",
      "scene": "station",
      "time": "週五 19:22",
      "bg": "xinyi",
      "cast": [
        "ray",
        "jason"
      ],
      "kind": "scene",
      "speaker": "立翔",
      "text": "我平常才跑三、四公里，不知道跟不跟得上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "station_09",
      "scene": "station",
      "time": "週五 19:22",
      "bg": "xinyi",
      "cast": [
        "ray"
      ],
      "kind": "scene",
      "speaker": "Ray",
      "text": "路口都會等，跟不上就喊一聲。"
